            "summary": "We study polarised degenerations of $n$-dimensional Calabi-Yau hypersurfaces $\\{ F_0F_1\\ldots F_m+tF=0\\} $, where the essential skeleton has dimension $1\\leq m\\leq n-1$. We will describe the limiting behaviour of the Calabi-Yau potential at the $C^0$-level, in terms of an optimal transport problem, and in terms of non-archimedean potential theory.",
